    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled within the mature, leafy surroundings of Fosterbrook, this exceptional four bedroom detached family home offers the perfect blend of generous accommodation, modern comforts and an unrivalled location. Presented in true walk-in condition, this superb residence is ideally positioned within a quiet and highly sought-after development, just a short stroll from the N11 Quality Bus Corridor, the DART, Blackrock Village and many of South Dublin's most prestigious primary and secondary schools.\n\nExtending to generously proportioned family accommodation, the home has been thoughtfully maintained and upgraded throughout. Upon entering, one is immediately struck by the sense of space and light that flows through the property. The elegant living room provides a wonderful setting for relaxing and entertaining and connects seamlessly through double doors to a large dining room. Glass sliding doors open directly onto the beautiful sunny rear garden, creating an ideal indoor-outdoor connection for modern family living.\nThe spacious kitchen forms the heart of the home and was stylishly renovated in 2017. Featuring contemporary finishes, ample storage and excellent workspace, it is flooded with natural light from a large picture window overlooking the garden and benefits from direct access to the outdoor space, making it perfect for everyday family life and summer entertaining alike.\n\nUpstairs, the accommodation is equally impressive, comprising three spacious double bedrooms and a large single bedroom. The principal bedroom enjoys the added luxury of an en suite bathroom, while a generously proportioned family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms. Each room is bright, well-appointed and designed to meet the needs of a growing family.\n\nA particular feature of the property is its beautiful private rear garden. Sunny and low maintenance, it offers a peaceful retreat with ample space for outdoor dining, relaxation and family enjoyment. To the front, there is off-street parking for two cars, adding further practicality and convenience to this outstanding home.\n\nFosterbrook is renowned for its tranquil surroundings and family-friendly atmosphere, while being exceptionally well connected. Residents enjoy easy access to Blackrock Village with its excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and shopping facilities, together with nearby parks, coastal walks and excellent transport links.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey detached family home in one of Blackrock's most desirable residential developments, offering spacious accommodation, a sunny private garden and exceptional convenience in a location that continues to be in strong demand.\n\n Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.40m x 2.09m\nBright hallway with glass panel in front door, carpet flooring.\n\nWC - 1.60m x 0.80m\nUnder stair WC, window for light and ventilation, Wash hand basin.\n\nLiving Room - 4.65m x 3.75m\nLarge living room with carpet flooring, fireplace with gas fire, alcoves with built in shelving, double doors to dining room.\n\nDining Room - 4.64m x 2.97m\nLarge dining room for family dining table and chairs, carpet flooring, glass sliding doors to garden.\n\nKitchen/ Breakfast Room - 6.60m x2.87m\nBright open kitchen with vinyl flooring, wall and floor hung units, dining area, integrated Zanussi oven with electric hob, tiles backsplash, stainless steel sink over looking the garden.\n\nLanding - 3.80m x 2.87m\nLarge landing with potential for attic conversion. Carpet stairs, window on the stairs for light. Hot press with shelving.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.64m x 3.46m\nMain double bedroom ensuite. Carpet flooring, built in wardrobes,\n\nEnsuite - 2.69m x 0.37m\nTiled floor and partially tiled walls, shower, wash hand basin and wc.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.95m x 2.97m\nLarge double bedroom overlooking the rear with carpet flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.85m x 2.87m\nDouble bedroom to the rear with carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.81m x 2.38m\nBedroom to the front with carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.85m x 1.86m\nTiled floor and partially tiled walls, window, bath, wash hand basin and wc.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Exceptional detached four bedroom family home.</li><li>Spacious accommodation throughout.</li><li>Measuring 1,270sq.ft. approx.</li><li>Sunny private rear garden.</li><li>Off-street parking for 2 cars.</li><li>Lovely residential location.</li><li>Great transport links.</li><li>Gas fired central heating.</li><li>T.V. & telephone points.</ul>"
      },
